menu "DAIDALUS"
config DAIDALUS_FILE_IO
    bool "Configuration and encounter file I/O"
    default n
    help
        Include file readers, writers and batch processing. The application
        must provide a mounted filesystem for filename-based operations.
        All computational functionality remains available when disabled.
config DAIDALUS_SINGLE_PRECISION
    bool "Compute in single precision"
    default n
    help
        Compute in float instead of double. The ESP32-S3 has a single
        precision FPU and emulates double in software. Results differ from
        the double build within the precision of float.
endmenu
